text As always, she's there.
text @[Tomoya]
text (What was her name again? Fuko?)
text She's engrossed in carving a block of wood.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text (Am I her guardian or something...?)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Of course not...)
text Fuko notices me and lifts her head.
text As if to tell me that she's okay, she spreads her palm out and shows it to me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah, yeah...
text I must be an annoyance to her. I signal to her that I understand, then leave.
