text @[Tomoya]
text (I guess I'll go home...)
text ...Why did I come here in the first place?
text Maybe I was just tired of walking.
text ...I can't go back without doing something first.
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's dance!
text So I start doing the Twist in the middle of the hall by myself.
text Dancing like this gives me a reason to have come here.
text @[Tomoya]
text Phew... what a fulfilling day of after-school activities.
text I feel empty, for some reason.
